1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,392
Dealing with breakouts and early signs of aging at the same time?

2
00:00:04,392 --> 00:00:09,306
Today we're looking at the Dermalogica AGE Bright Clearing Serum: what it does,

3
00:00:09,306 --> 00:00:11,296
what's in it, and how to use it.

4
00:00:12,058 --> 00:00:14,298
This is an active two-in-one serum.

5
00:00:14,298 --> 00:00:19,546
It clears and helps prevent breakouts, while reducing visible signs of skin aging.

6
00:00:20,246 --> 00:00:24,662
The active ingredient is salicylic acid, at two point zero percent.

7
00:00:25,362 --> 00:00:29,501
Niacinamide comes second on the ingredient list, right after water.

8
00:00:30,201 --> 00:00:34,553
Niacinamide is paired with white shiitake mushroom, for a brighter, more

9
00:00:34,553 --> 00:00:35,944
even-looking skin tone.

10
00:00:36,704 --> 00:00:40,928
The AGE Bright Complex works with the skin's natural microbiome.

11
00:00:41,628 --> 00:00:45,873
And phytoactives from the resurrection plant help hydrate and smooth the skin.

12
00:00:46,573 --> 00:00:51,098
The serum comes in a thirty milliliter bottle, and a ten milliliter mini is part of

13
00:00:51,098 --> 00:00:52,406
the Active Clearing Kit.

14
00:00:53,161 --> 00:00:54,419
So how do you use it?

15
00:00:54,419 --> 00:00:57,833
After cleansing, apply a thin layer, and allow it to dry.

16
00:00:58,533 --> 00:01:00,574
Then follow with your moisturizer.

17
00:01:00,574 --> 00:01:02,736
Use it up to twice a day, as needed.

18
00:01:03,436 --> 00:01:06,554
If your skin is sensitive, build up to daily use.

19
00:01:06,554 --> 00:01:10,945
If you're sensitive to salicylic acid, patch test first, or avoid it.

20
00:01:11,645 --> 00:01:17,170
To recap: two point zero percent salicylic acid, niacinamide with white shiitake,

21
00:01:17,170 --> 00:01:21,195
and a thin layer under your moisturizer, up to twice a day.

22
00:01:21,195 --> 00:01:23,310
The link is in the description.
